    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d746-a1">

                <pb facs="0977" n="881" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg881"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-04-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 27,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chyo Pyengjik, minister for foreign affairs, to the Hon.
                        H. N. Allen, United States minister.</hi>
                </p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your excellency’s dispatch of to-day’s date concerning the state of war now
                    existing between the United States and Spain.</p>
                <p>In reply thereto I have the honor to assure your excellency that my Government
                    will observe the strictest neutrality in this affair.</p>
                <p>I beg your excellency to convey this message to your Government.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
